{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">九巴為北都開辦的首條路線，下周一投入服務。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BUS-1130.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026m4vK6hCrOn1786681169.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BUS-1130.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">為配合即將入伙的北都首個公屋項目鳳凰嶺邨，新路線77號下周一起每日朝六晚八，來往鳳凰嶺邨及上水太平，途經粉嶺聯和墟、百和路及北區醫院一帶。全程車費5.8元，設雙向分段收費優惠，預計最快第四季延長至古洞北。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BUS-1130_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Q9PeTf9p241786681163.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.BUS-1130_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">另外，九巴亦正籌備開辦另外六條新路線，由粉嶺北及古洞北等地往返上水、東九龍、深水埗及荃灣葵芳等，會視乎入伙進度及客量需求，經與運輸署落實後再公布。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T04:38:54.976291+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}